Create a `FormArray` and bind it directly to the `<form>` with `[formArray]`; use each control’s index with `formControlName`:

```ts
form = new FormArray([
  new FormControl('fish'),
  new FormControl('cat'),
  new FormControl('dog'),
]);
```

```html
<form [formArray]="form">
  @for (control of form.controls; track $index) {
    <input [formControlName]="$index" />
  }
</form>
```
